# ====================================================================
# NOVACODE AUTHENTICATION & SUPABASE CONFIGURATION
# ====================================================================
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy your Project URL and anon public API key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here

# GOOGLE OAUTH CONFIGURATION IN SUPABASE:
# In your Supabase dashboard:
# 1. Go to Authentication -> Providers -> Google
# 2. Enable Google
# 3. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID in Google Cloud Console:
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins: https://your-project-id.supabase.co and http://localhost:3000
#    - Authorized redirect URI: https://your-project-id.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 4. Paste Client ID and Client Secret in Supabase dashboard
